and Ghost World Labs branding.\n  - **v4 \"Project Cockpit\"** (built + merged to master 2026-06-13): each lane is a tile with one honest status light; clicking expands an **inline panel** (summary on top, resizable xterm.js terminal below) rather than a new page. Adds skill auto-load-once/greet-once (killing a repeating-prompt bug), a Claudeâ†”Gemini engine toggle, per-lane doc roles, a project cost/tokens/time rollup, grass-idea promotion, and type-aware deliverable launch.\n\n- **North Star of the R&D work (locked):** make each project's window a calm, single-screen cockpit where opening a session *feels exactly like a normal Claude Code / Gemini session* â€” the lane's skill loads once, greets once, then behaves normally.\n\nOne caveat on grounding: these claims come from the project's own `CLAUDE.md` and frozen planning docs, which state v2/v3/v4 are \"built and merged.\" I haven't independently run or inspected the code this turn â€” say the word and I'll verify any specific claim against the actual source."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4410,"cache_read_input_tokens":45325,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4410,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4e9f3ac4-e6f1-4129-b8cf-8b7b247b9305","uuid":"46bb6416-c09c-4eb9-bfc0-3a444ae78f81","request_id":"req_011Cc1fUpKUhSiT8QWEWPnoK"}
